            "detailed_description": "Action-packed death racing, this is what Speed Kills is about! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraditional, isometric, powered by Unreal Engine. Players compete in various championships, ranging from bootleg rallies on the outskirts of the galaxy to big-league circuits set against the goliath skylines of metropolis cityscapes. You can purchase offensive and defensive vehicle upgrades, buy new cars, collect power-ups and earn bonuses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES<br />\r\n• Classic gameplay, inspired by the 16-bit isometric racing games<br />\r\n• 5 planets/championships to compete<br />\r\n• Over 50 unique tracks<br />\r\n• 8 fully customizable and upgradable vehicles, ranging from beefed-up pickup trucks to futuristic hovercars",
            "about_the_game": "Action-packed death racing, this is what Speed Kills is about! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraditional, isometric, powered by Unreal Engine. Players compete in various championships, ranging from bootleg rallies on the outskirts of the galaxy to big-league circuits set against the goliath skylines of metropolis cityscapes. You can purchase offensive and defensive vehicle upgrades, buy new cars, collect power-ups and earn bonuses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES<br />\r\n• Classic gameplay, inspired by the 16-bit isometric racing games<br />\r\n• 5 planets/championships to compete<br />\r\n• Over 50 unique tracks<br />\r\n• 8 fully customizable and upgradable vehicles, ranging from beefed-up pickup trucks to futuristic hovercars",
