                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I can't recommend this game but it's not game breaking is just too many factors to lost but I personally think it's a skill issue on my end! Man but trying to get powerup and the ramps up and down screw me over than the AI bots most of the time! The ramps flip me over but the bots perfectly land it everytime only time I see the AI crash is when they slightly bump into each other. This requires you to win every single match to move to next tournament is unfair as heck but a good challenge if you love this stick driver type of games!",
